sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant F as frontend (nginx)
    participant BFF as bff (Token Handler)
    participant BE as backend
    participant R as Redis

    B->>F: POST /api/auth/login (credenciales)
    F->>BFF: proxy_pass
    BFF->>BE: POST /auth/login
    BE-->>BFF: access JWT + refresh JWT
    BFF->>R: guarda tokens bajo sid
    BFF-->>F: Set-Cookie BFF_SESSION (opaca)
    F-->>B: 200 OK + cookie

    Note over B,BE: el navegador nunca recibe ni ve el JWT
